@startuml 20-run-stop
!include style.iuml
title How a Run stops
start
:Run works through the queue;
if (A stop condition holds?) then (yes)
  :Gate latched or closed;
  note right
    429 or 403 from e-GP (latched)
    3 requests in a row unanswered
    A web page instead of data (site closed)
    Administrator stop
    Lease taken over by another Run
  end note
  :No new request goes to e-GP\nNothing new leaves the queue\nQueued projects keep their state, no attempt spent;
  :Analysis finishes the archives it already holds;
else (no)
  :Continue until Discovery is done,\nthe queue is empty and every Analysis has settled;
endif
:Run ends;
stop
@enduml
